; Main-gauche — off-hand parrying dagger. Metal only, Weaponsmithing/forge
; crafted. Real weapon type (not SHIELD) so it flows through the existing
; Two-Weapon wield/attack path unmodified; SHIELDGRIP flags it for a future
; Stage 2 special case in shieldDefenseBonus/armorEnchantBonus, which
; computes its DefBonus dynamically as max(3, Two-Weapon skill level) rather
; than reading PARAMETER1 — so PARAMETER1 is free to serve its normal
; isWeapon() role here: the crafting skill level (weapons use PARAMETER1 for
; this, not PARAMETER2 — see the comment in doCraft). 10 is comparable to a
; metal round/large-round shield's tier — off-hand precision smithing, not
; entry-level but not the top of the scale either.
