; Leather & Cloth Armors sheet. Substance HIDE is a NEW substance value (the
; designer's Substances sheet formalizes it as "leather items/armor pieces").
; doCraft routes HIDE to Dyeing/Weaving (skill 15) via its own branch, ahead
; of the generic ARMOR branch, using PARAMETER2 for the skill level just like
; the metal pieces above (CLOTH-substance items below also use PARAMETER2,
; via the pre-existing CLOTH branch). Dyeing/Weaving has the widest confirmed
; real range of any craft skill in this game (1-40 across 91 pre-existing
; items), so these lean into that scale rather than staying timid.
